<title>USA: Diana declines comment on stock activity.</title>
<headline>Diana declines comment on stock activity.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE, Wis. 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Diana Corp said Monday it would not comment on the activity of its stock.</p>
<p>Diana fell five points to close at 40-1/4 in light volume Monday.</p>
<p>Diana's Treasurer Scott Miswald said the statement was prompted by an inquiry from the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
